Error [E0120]: `text` was not moved here, so it cannot be captured by a spawned task
  --> tests/ui/param_task_capture_needs_copy.jet:4:25
    |
  4 |     task :: tasks.spawn(() => text.len())
    |                         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: this function can access the parameter, but it does not own the value
 Fix: copy it into an owned local first: `owned :: ~text`
